From: Jacob Pyke <jacob@pyk.ee>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: il97680a: use the Linux 7.2 orientation helper

Adapt the upstream candidate to Armada's Linux 7.2.6 build. The helper
was renamed after that release; only the name differs here.

This is a local test compatibility patch. Do not include it in the
upstream mailing-list series. No panel behavior is changed.

Signed-off-by: Jacob Pyke <jacob@pyk.ee>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-il97680a.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-il97680a.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-il97680a.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-il97680a.c
@@ -351,7 +351,7 @@
 	pinfo->dsi = dsi;
 	mipi_dsi_set_drvdata(dsi, pinfo);
 
-	ret = drm_of_get_panel_orientation(dev->of_node, &pinfo->orientation);
+	ret = of_drm_get_panel_orientation(dev->of_node, &pinfo->orientation);
 	if (ret < 0)
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "Failed to get orientation\n");
 
